  "equivalent": [
    {
      "name": "a missing part is not a refusal (canonicalize unwrapped)",
      "file": "crates/cancho-ui/src/sources.rs",
      "from": "        let Ok(canon) = full.canonicalize() else {\n            return Err(missing(\"does not exist\".to_string()));\n        };",
      "to": "        let canon = full.canonicalize().unwrap_or(full.clone());",
      "why": "measured: a file that is not there has no real path, so the unwrapped path is not a file and is refused as `part-missing` by the next test, with the same tag; a refusal is still the answer and only its message differs."
